{"v":4,"catch":"人類的最後一戰臨近，多虧了 Project V...","desc":"《REZON》是 ALLUMER 於 1991 年發售的一款射擊遊戲。\n外星人入侵期間，玩家將在地球上控制一艘配備 VAWS（Variable Armor & Weapon System）的 SR-91 戰鬥機並與入侵者作戰。\n拾取物品並裝備武器，這是一項關鍵功能，可讓您在使用得當時從身後攻擊或阻擋敵人的射擊。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-04-06","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8ec7b898da1eae54d9f5ce42e83c8987aa8664a2232328bedd01c35f7ad050f3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/543082025399c9a4fb05f6ee0172cf87df9142f6c003c3e32c28cb7f378a24a3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fc17e22aaaad5a02435d88220e11d0f5f3a1fb43c48a4095c983bf41dd3f7544.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/72f0d0a9c9416f4a37b35490ca9bf9bea841541b476fc3d1b0e2c6024d2b804d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a3dc8581af037fb33e55f8ba1bc84df82023518e58bba1086fdf8e9593ce8313.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/042bdd619bac69b566592a1a7c6101b4c24512807189f1fd534b2a9ba3297759.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ca201ab16000","dlc":[]}